# IP analysis kept out of the public tree on purpose. This repository is public
# under three remotes, and a public description of a mechanism can start novelty
# clocks in some jurisdictions and can also hand a competitor the reproduction
# path. The public stub at docs/campusguard/11-ip-analysis.md says what is being
# withheld and why; the analysis itself lives here and is not committed.
docs/campusguard/private/
